# Demo project rules

- Prefer small, reviewable diffs.
- Run tests before opening a pull request.
- Do not commit secrets or local MCP credentials.
- Keep agent instructions in `.cursor/rules` concise and non-duplicative.
- When changing scan behavior, update fixture expectations in the same change.

These rules exist so CLI scan walks `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` instead of skipping
the whole `.cursor` directory.
